        {
          "path": "_m/g/c/c/b/arranmore-wp/aranmore-island-ferry-with-ful.jpg",
          "filename": "Aranmore Island - Ferry with 'full\" load. - geograph.org.uk - 1166102.jpg",
          "caption": "Aranmore Island - Ferry with 'full\" load. When I saw the vehicles lined up to be loaded on to the ferry at Leabgarrow Harbour on Aranmore Island, I didn't think it would be possible to load all of the vehicles on to the ferry. But, the ferry crew was patient and able to load 3 trucks, 3 trailers, and 1 passenger vehicle on to the ferry by man handling each piece of equipment to get it to fit. They were barely able to close the ferry door.",
          "alt": "Aranmore Island - Ferry with 'full\" load. When I saw the vehicles lined up to be loaded on to the ferry at Leabgarrow Harbour on Aranmore Island, I didn't think it would be possible to load all of the vehicles on to the ferry. But, the ferry crew was patient and able to load 3 trucks, 3 trailers, and 1 passenger vehicle on to the ferry by man handling each piece of equipment to get it to fit. They were barely able to close the ferry door.",
